r <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/38px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/50px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Magic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\">Wild Magic</a> when casting spells.</dd></dl>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spellseeking_Gloves\" title=\"Spellseeking Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Spellseeking_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Spellseeking_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/6/66/Spellseeking_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Spellseeking_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Spellseeking_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Spellseeking_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><br><a href=\"/wiki/Spellseeking_Gloves\" title=\"Spellseeking Gloves\"> <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Spellseeking Gloves</span> </a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" title=\"Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/38px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gloves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gloves\">Gloves</a>&nbsp;(<a href=\"/wiki/Handwear#Non-Armour\" title=\"Handwear\">Non-Armour</a>)\n</td>\n<td><dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Seeking_Spell\" title=\"Seeking Spell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp/40px-Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp/60px-Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp/80px-Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Seeking Spell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp/40px-Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Seeking_Spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Seeking_Spell\" title=\"Seeking Spell\">Seeking Spell</a></span></dt><dd>When you make a <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Attack Roll\">Spell Attack Roll</a>, you can spend a <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/20px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/30px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/40px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/20px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcery_Point\" title=\"Sorcery Point\">Sorcery Point</a> to gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>. This costs 1 Sorcery Point per spell slot Level. <a href=\"/wiki/Cantrip\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cantrip\">Cantrips</a> cost 1 Sorcery Point.</dd></dl>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714232248\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.078 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.081 s